{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year 2135, the world is ruled by AI Corporations, humans are slowly being replaced by robots and machines, and the most powerful humans are now looking for ways to transfer their souls into robots, for eternal life. Doctor Robotus is kidnapped in front of your eyes, can you become the savior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875350/extras/2a366f9af3a94d416efa8cb1c5b1b5b6.poster.avif?t=1772457306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875350/extras/2a366f9af3a94d416efa8cb1c5b1b5b6.webm?t=1772457306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875350/extras/2a366f9af3a94d416efa8cb1c5b1b5b6.mp4?t=1772457306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way thru four stylish platforming worlds, surviving a large variation of different robots and machines that only have one mission, stop you from reaching your goal: saving Dr Robotus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills, become more powerful and stronger as you progress through the game. When you die you get \u201creset\u201d and lose some of your skills. The less you die, the more powerful you will be to defeat the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875350/extras/53ecc72a67f9b3c78d6a1b263b28b079.poster.avif?t=1772457306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875350/extras/53ecc72a67f9b3c78d6a1b263b28b079.webm?t=1772457306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"